      <div>
        <head n="2" source="#source-328-364"><seg source="#source-328-331">１</seg></head>
        <p><seg source="#source-366-380">鴉は――</seg></p>
        <p><seg source="#source-380-396">異教徒だ</seg></p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <head n="2" source="#source-396-432"><seg source="#source-396-399">２</seg></head>
        <p><seg source="#source-434-448">誰だ――</seg></p>
        <p><seg source="#source-448-497">坂の上で笛を鳴らして逃げたのは</seg></p>
        <p><seg source="#source-497-536">母よ、もうラムプを消そう。</seg></p>
      </div>
    </body>
